@startuml

title Purchase Plants Sequence Diagram

participant User
boundary Browser
participant WebApp
participant Auth
entity Cart
entity Order
database DB

Customer->Browser: Select plant & click "Add to Cart"
Browser->WebApp: POST /cart/add
WebApp->Auth: validateSession()
Auth-->WebApp: valid

WebApp->Cart: addItem(userId, plantId)
Cart->DB: INSERT cart_item
DB-->Cart: success
Cart-->WebApp: item added
WebApp-->Browser: cart updated

Customer->Browser: Open Cart
Browser->WebApp: GET /cart
WebApp->Auth: validateSession()
Auth-->WebApp: valid

WebApp->Cart: getCart()
Cart->DB: SELECT cart items
DB-->Cart: results
Cart-->WebApp: cart items
WebApp-->Browser: render cart page

Customer->Browser: Click "Order Now"
Browser->WebApp: POST /orders/checkout
WebApp->Auth: validateSession()
Auth-->WebApp: valid

WebApp->Cart: getCart()
Cart->DB: SELECT cart items
DB-->Cart: results
Cart-->WebApp: cart items

alt cart empty
    WebApp-->Browser: show "Cart is empty"
else cart has items
    WebApp->Order: createOrder(cartItems)
    Order->DB: INSERT order
    DB-->Order: order ID
    Order->DB: INSERT order items
    DB-->Order: success
    Order->DB: UPDATE plant quantities
    DB-->Order: success
    Order-->WebApp: confirmation

    WebApp->Cart: clearCart()
    Cart->DB: DELETE cart items
    DB-->Cart: success
    Cart-->WebApp: cleared

    WebApp-->Browser: render order confirmation
end

@enduml